{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>In the free Demo, you can expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short, limited slice of the chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a painful little walk through the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No checkpoints. No forgiveness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Surprise traps waiting to ruin your day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-op's not here yet \u2014 that\u2019s for the full version.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you survive this, maybe you're ready for the full version.<br><br><strong>Good Luck</strong> is a third-person, physics-based rage platformer where you walk through a city filled with unexpected traps, absurd dangers, and no second chances, no mercy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just get to your meeting.<br>That\u2019s it, just walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sounds easy, right?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>One small mistake? Back to the start. No Mercy!</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667930/extras/gif_slide.gif?t=1744916983\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Learn by failing\u2014again and again!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667930/extras/gif_die.gif?t=1744916983\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>There's One Simple Goal: Survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667930/extras/explode.gif?t=1744916983\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Co-op Mode Coming Soon!</strong> <br>Because suffering with friends is just better.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you patient enough? <br>Are you stubborn enough? <br>Let\u2019s find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Good Luck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667930/extras/TEXT.png?t=1744916983\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epilepsy warning: contains some surprising elements.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Demo Completed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3667930/ea3a22fa62b5c503a23216834983e7dbbb709f19.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667930?t=1744916983","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667930?t=1744916983","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667930/0567e7bb41391ca007a3102df5eb5a1407ae4862/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744916983","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667930/0567e7bb41391ca007a3102df5eb5a1407ae4862/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744916983","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>DON'T FORGET TO WHISTLIST!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667930/extras/addtowishlist_gif__1_.gif?t=1744916983\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>In the free Demo, you can expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short, limited slice of the chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a painful little walk through the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No checkpoints. No forgiveness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Surprise traps waiting to ruin your day.</p></li><li>